    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n97652" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγκατά-κειμαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lie with</i>, of
			sexual intercourse, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδράσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ec.</u>
					614
				</span></i>
			 (anap.): abs., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				191e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				255e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>recline with at meals</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δεσπότῃ</span>, of a dog, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).291
			</span></i>: abs., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ συγκατακείμενοι</span>
			<i>the guests</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.660a
			</span></i>.</div>
